While working on this task, I was surprised by how easily people can become victims of online payment fraud. I realized that even a small mistake, such as clicking an unknown link or sharing an OTP, can lead to serious financial loss. This made me more aware of the importance of digital security in everyday life.

As a result, I will be more cautious while making online transactions and will avoid sharing any sensitive information. I will also verify the authenticity of messages and calls before taking any action. This task helped me understand how important it is to stay alert and informed in the digital world.
